# Audit-log test artifacts: `AuditLog::no_op()` predates the
# explicit `disabled` flag and could historically create this
# directory in the cwd on a failing test run. The flag now
# short-circuits before any FS touch, but the ignore stays as
# belt-and-suspenders against a future regression.
